! v1.19.0: fills a cell of the capability matrix that no test
! reached.  The Hybrid column had Opt+Freq at
! `not run`: B3LYP is the functional class most users actually
! run, and its opt-then-freq path was verified nowhere.
!
! This is a TRIPWIRE, not an oracle: the pinned value was recorded
! from this build.  It proves the path keeps producing what it
! produces today, which is what the empty cell was missing.
! Also carries the two physics invariants that make an optimization
! self-checking: the converged max gradient must be under %grad_tol,
! and a true minimum has no imaginary frequency.
%method B3LYP
%basis sto-3g
%grid 3
%job opt+freq
%geom angstrom
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.120000
H   0.000000   0.760000  -0.470000
H   0.000000  -0.760000  -0.470000
*end
